# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: forCharacteristic is functional. One value quantifies
# exactly one quality. A value claiming to be both a robustness and a
# reliability states nothing about either.
@prefix iso:  <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989#> .
@prefix inst: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989/instances#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso22989/neg#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso22989/neg05> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso22989/instances/2.0.0> .
ex:Value1 a iso:CharacteristicValue ;
    iso:forCharacteristic inst:Robustness , inst:Reliability .
